{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Fruitimo!",
    "steam_appid": 3345000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/058a26ff624051b69b5f44298bac6734.avif?t=1754035863\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fruit-loving boy <strong>[Vimita] </strong>and his backpack-shaped android <strong>[Grandpa]</strong> team up in the action adventure to collect giant fruits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s explore the mysterious and fun theme park <strong>[Kajune Land].</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/6201eb3ca91d6e59ffc532c94e87cab4.avif?t=1754035863\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are lots of curious places in <strong>[Kajune Land]</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >juice river, sherbet hill, as well drones, robots, and even slides!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge fruits are hidden all over the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/b3f585d89d561d7bdca712e0edeac731.avif?t=1754035863\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vimita and Grandpa work together - throwing jelly, vacuuming up fruits, and questing for hidden treats using a search function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the juicy and colorful world and collect all the fruits!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/058a26ff624051b69b5f44298bac6734.avif?t=1754035863\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fruit-loving boy <strong>[Vimita] </strong>and his backpack-shaped android <strong>[Grandpa]</strong> team up in the action adventure to collect giant fruits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s explore the mysterious and fun theme park <strong>[Kajune Land].</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/6201eb3ca91d6e59ffc532c94e87cab4.avif?t=1754035863\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are lots of curious places in <strong>[Kajune Land]</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >juice river, sherbet hill, as well drones, robots, and even slides!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge fruits are hidden all over the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/b3f585d89d561d7bdca712e0edeac731.avif?t=1754035863\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vimita and Grandpa work together - throwing jelly, vacuuming up fruits, and questing for hidden treats using a search function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the juicy and colorful world and collect all the fruits!</p>",
